    "final_answer": "I've found the perfect course that matches all the requirements. Let me provide my final answer.\n\n## ✅ Course Found: **\"人工智能（AI）简介\" (Introduction to AI)**\n\n### Course Details:\n- **Provider**: IBM\n- **URL**: https://www.coursera.org/learn/introduction-to-ai\n- **Level**: Beginner (初级) ✅ Suitable for beginners\n- **Duration**: Approximately 1 week (10 hours/week recommended)\n- **Rating**: 4.7/5 (based on 23,391 reviews)\n- **Enrollment**: 12,258,065 students\n\n### Course Modules (4 modules total):\n1. **AI 简介与应用** (Introduction to AI and its Applications)\n2. **AI 概念、术语和应用领域** (AI Concepts, Terminology and Application Areas)\n3. **通过 AI 实现业务和职业转型** (Business and Career Transformation through AI)\n4. **✅ 问题、关注点和伦理考虑因素 (Issues, Concerns, and Ethical Considerations)** — This module specifically addresses ethical considerations\n\n### Why this course matches the requirements:\n1. ✅ It's an introductory course on artificial intelligence\n2. ✅ It's explicitly designed for beginners (marked as \"初级\" / beginner level)\n3. ✅ Module 4 specifically focuses on ethical considerations (\"伦理考虑因素\")\n\nAdditionally, the course's \"What you'll learn\" objectives explicitly mention: \"针对组织面临的挑战，结合伦理方面的考虑，设计一个 AI 生成解决方案\" (Design an AI-generated solution to organizational challenges, taking ethical considerations into account). It also lists \"负责任的人工智能\" (Responsible AI) as one of the skills you'll gain.",
